@startuml sample-conversion-flow
!theme plain
title Sample Conversion — TaskConfig → inspect_ai Sample
caption tasks_to_samples() transforms YAML-derived configs into inspect_ai evaluation objects.

start

:tasks_to_samples(tasks, domain_root, renderer);

partition "Per TaskConfig → Sample" {

    :rendered_prompts = renderer.render_all_prompts(\n  task.prompts, task\n);
    note right
      PromptRenderer uses Jinja2.
      Template vars from TaskConfig:
      • task_id, title, description
      • initial_context (domain-specific)
      • All model fields as template vars
    end note

    :rendered_instruction = rendered_prompts["instruction"];

    partition "Build Sample.input" {
        :ChatMessageSystem(content=rendered_instruction);
        :ChatMessageUser(content=task.description);
        :input = [system_msg, user_msg];
    }

    partition "Extract target answer" {
        :Find first scorer with\ntarget == SUBMISSION;
        if (StaticCriteria?) then (yes)
            :target = expected_answers[0];
        elseif (LLMJudgeCriteria?) then (yes)
            :target = golden_answer;
        else (no match)
            :target = "";
        endif
    }

    partition "Build metadata" {
        :Common metadata:
        • task_id, title, description
        • initial_context (model_dump)
        • prompts (model_dump)
        • tools (model_dump per tool)
        • max_steps, tool_call_limit;

        :Prompt metadata (rendered strings):
        • instruction_prompt
        • assistant_prompt
        • submit_prompt
        • continue_prompt;
        note right
          **Key for solver_factory:**
          saber_agent_solver reads these
          from state.metadata at solve-time
          for per-sample prompt injection.
        end note

        :Scoring metadata:
        • scorers (list of model_dump)
        • scoring_aggregation;
    }

    partition "Resolve sandbox" {
        if (task.sandbox != None?) then (yes)
            :sandbox = ("docker",\n  domain_root/compose/{name}.compose.yml);
        else (no)
            :sandbox = None;
        endif
    }

    partition "Resolve files" {
        if (task.initial_files not empty?) then (yes)
            :files = {dest: domain_root/source\n  for dest, source in initial_files};
        else (no)
            :files = {};
        endif
    }

    :Return Sample(\n  id=task_id,\n  input=[system, user],\n  target=target,\n  metadata=metadata,\n  sandbox=sandbox,\n  files=files\n);
}

:Return list[Sample];

stop

legend right
  **Metadata keys read by downstream components:**
  | Key | Consumer |
  | instruction_prompt | saber_agent_solver |
  | assistant_prompt | saber_agent_solver |
  | continue_prompt | saber_agent_solver |
  | tools | saber_agent_solver (per-sample resolution) |
  | max_steps | saber_agent_solver (tool_call_limit) |
  | task_id | ScorerFactory (scorer naming) |
  | scorers | ScorerFactory (inline scorer creation) |
  | scoring_aggregation | ScorerFactory (aggregate score) |
  | description | JudgeTemplateContext |
  | initial_context | PromptRenderer templates |
end legend

@enduml
